airbnb-axi is a standalone CLI with its own transport, data normalization,
capture and replay format, requirement assessor, and companion agent skill.

Public-page extraction patterns and portions of the geocoding logic were
adapted from OpenBnB's mcp-server-airbnb version 0.3.0, commit
d5a8f18f5978b0a33dea4b3ec130c389bad845cc.

